      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the fd to communicate with the thread that posts to uhid. The fd might be valid even before uhid_open is invoked. We only queue the input events though. Here\u0027s all possible events:\n\ninput_evt: Peripheral notify input event. queued\ndscp_evt: To open uhid. Immediately executed otherwise uhid_open won\u0027t be called.\nclose_evt: To close uhid, immediately executed.\nget_report_evt: Reply to get report. Receiving get report from uhid means uhid_open was previously called.\nset_report_evt: similar to get_report_evt.",
